  "summary": "Malicious code in @saidddddddddd/ggsgg (npm)",
  "details": "The package ships an empty index.js and a loader (index.html and index.svg) that, when opened, fetches the latest version of the package from unpkg[.]com at runtime and injects the returned HTML/scripts into the page. The executed content is therefore fetched live from the publisher's own package and can be changed at any time by publishing a new version, making the runtime behaviour fully publisher-controlled rather than fixed at install time.",
